WEBVTT

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:27.780
That's it for today's class.

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:31.830
Don't forget to do your homework!

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.180
Got it?

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.180
'kay!

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.080
And be careful on your way home, everyone.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.090
Goddamn it's hot!

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:50.140
Prince: Male

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:50.140
Job:

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:50.140
EX: 999999999999

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:50.140
POW: 132
AGL: 212
DEF: 171
INT: 256

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:50.140
MAG: 199
SKL: 143
CRM: 00
HAX: 256

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.140
Prince?

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:57.140
"Hey! I'm the Prince of Planet Dogura!

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:57.140
I'm coming to kidnap

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:57.140
you now, thanks!"

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:57.140
"Hey! I'm the Prince of Planet Dogura! I'm coming to kidnap you now, thanks!"

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.820
What is it, Mayuzumi?

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:02.350
What's this?

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:20.600
The towns entrance is adorned with a cow's skull

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:25.560
It's fine that the law is decided by the strongest,

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.550
But this simple feeling will not be enough to fulfill you

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:36.030
Everyone will definitely revolt and shortly disappear

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:41.310
That's a shocking bloody picture

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:46.460
I'm feeling nauseous

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:56.670
Holding my head, I board the subway

00:01:56.670 --> 00:02:07.110
Righteous way of living, righteous way of dying

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:17.560
Who on earth knows or what the hell can show me?

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.750
Cold finger girl

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.900
Sit Down

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:53.260
Presently, hundreds of alien species come to and go from the Earth, living their lives.

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:59.100
There are friendly species, but also aggressive ones.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:02:59.870
Yes!

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:01.890
You have been chosen...

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:05.580
to be Justice Rangers!

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:09.810
Hey... The kidnapper's blabbing about something.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:12.830
Who cares about justice? Untie us, you jerk!

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.830
I am the Prince of Dogura.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:20.360
I have cooooooooome to protect the peace of Earth!

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:23.700
I am the official chairman of the defense task force!

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.650
An alien, huh?

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:27.840
You just look like a pervert to me.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.670
W-Whoa!

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:32.180
We're actually up in space!

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:33.620
He's real!

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:36.150
He's a real alien!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.390
Shut up!

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:43.720
From this moment on, you will surely be traveling a path fraught with numerous hardships...

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.580
but as they say on Earth,

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.820
"Work hard in your youth, and it's sure to pay off!"

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:51.540
I'm gonna be late for my date...

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.330
Class Rep, do it.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:58.120
Convince him to let us go home straight away.

00:03:58.490 --> 00:03:59.870
W-Why?

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:01.840
Why am I always the one doing the dangerous stuff?

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.770
Stop complainin' and get to it, wimp!

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:05.840
R-Right...

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:10.160
It is through struggle that people can shine ever brighter, yes!

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:10.970
U-Uh...

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:13.760
Yes! Struggle will make people stronger!

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:17.950
I will hold back my tears and harden my heart, in order to put you through the trials...

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:19.920
U-Uh...

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.020
What is it?

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:23.230
Would you do me a favor and not interrupt me?

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:25.350
I-I apologize...

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.990
We're very thankful for your thorough and valuable opinion,

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:31.200
but we have various circumstances, like dates,

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:35.240
or needing to heed the call of nature, or karate practice, or cram school...

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:39.120
Perhaps we could draw today's session to a close... or something?

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:45.090
Do you truly believe those activities are more important than the peace of Earth?

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:48.510
Uh... well...

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.760
So? Answer me clearly!

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:52.270
I'm sorry!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.060
I was wrong!

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.390
Idiots.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.570
I made him mad...

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:00.380
First you're all humble, then you even apologize!?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.230
You're freakin' useless!

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:05.260
What time is it?

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:06.630
5:05.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:10.320
It's getting late. This ain't good, man.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:15.110
Hey, how about we do what he says until he lets us go home?

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:18.460
There's nothing we can do while we're out of the atmosphere, after all.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.850
Shit... I don't like the sound of that.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:23.390
Hey, alien!

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:25.660
We'll do that allies of justice thing!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:27.420
So, let us go home now!

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:30.930
You changed your mind?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:35.380
Then, I will bestow upon you amazing powers.

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:43.390
Now, let us begin...

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.120
Uh...

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:20.090
B-Blue Charge.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:23.160
Change Color Ranger!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:45.980
I'm... the Blue Ranger...

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:56.360
Howdy, Yellow.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:57.720
Howdy, Blue...

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.200
Did you try it?

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:07.230
Yup. Burst out laughing in front of the mirror.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.150
Then afterwards I started cryin' for some reason.

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:17.150
I'm worried about my allergies.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:19.240
Cheap stuff always ends up giving me a rash.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.520
You rich kids sure think about different stuff.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:25.340
Can't you and your money do something about this?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:29.240
I can't go telling the old man about what's going on.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.100
Hey, Mayuzumi!

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.950
Notice anything different lately?

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.630
I had a dream...

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:41.510
An eggplant-colored princess was spinning around a baby toad.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.710
Same as usual.

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:46.040
He was asleep so he doesn't remember.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.700
I think it's best we don't tell 'im.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.860
Good morning everyone!

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:53.220
Hey, hey!

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:54.210
Did you try it out?

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:55.690
It was so super awesome!

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:59.580
I haven't been so moved in my entire life!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.320
Everyone, it's just so...

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:04.310
Shut up!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.170
That hurt!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:11.380
I'm the red one, so that makes me the leader! We all decided!

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:15.120
We're pissed 'cause yer all hyped up so goddamn early in the morning, <i>Leader</i>!

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:18.450
It's embarrassing, so keep your damn voice down, <i>Leader</i>!

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:20.260
I-I'm sorry...

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.690
But, it's so amazing!

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:26.230
That alien must have technology that allows him to control matter at the atomic level!

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.900
Or wait, maybe he can freely manipulate the missing mass in the universe,

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.740
known as dark matter, using the power of his mind, like magic!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.190
Goddamn he's loud.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:38.110
Because the moment I say the words "Red Charge", my body...

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.480
You idiot!

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.750
Transformin' so the whole school can hear you?

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.940
I-I'm sorry...

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:53.010
What a shock!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:55.670
Now, now... No running in the hallways!

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:57.220
Sorry.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:01.420
Akagawa-kun feels like he's gonna puke, so we're carrying him to the bathroom!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.230
Wait, Akagawa-kun...

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.910
What's with that outfit?

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:16.770
What?

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:18.330
She's an alien...

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.900
That's not Tachibana-sensei.

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:23.780
L-Like some reptoid...

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:28.400
Idiot... You're so hyped up you overcharged your damn brain.

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:29.700
That's not true!

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:34.810
These goggles have the power to perceive aliens that have disguised themselves as humans.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:39.200
If you don't believe me, you should transform yourself.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.780
H-Hey...

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:50.310
Seriously?

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:05.010
S-Sensei, this is the boy's bathroom...

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:07.410
How does Akagawa-kun feel?

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.620
U-U-Uh...

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:14.970
Sounds like he's still no good.

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:18.780
I'll take care of him now.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:21.050
You two, return to the classroom.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.720
But we're worried, see...

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:26.090
Go back.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:31.170
This is for real, isn't it?

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:35.530
Then Tachibana-sensei's real identity is just like Akagawa said?

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.650
Akagawa-kun, unlock the door.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:40.420
Let's go to the nurse's office.

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.920
N-No! Stay away!

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:44.800
That's quite harsh of you.

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:48.000
Is that really how you should speak to your teacher?

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.030
Teacher?

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:54.320
What's wrong?

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:55.370
Tell me...

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:58.270
Tell me what's wrong?

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:15.980
Stay after school.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.520
And those two, as well.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:20.350
If you don't, I'll visit your parents.

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:22.600
Got it?

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:28.280
G7.

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.340
F.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.370
G.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:52.480
Tachibana-sensei is an alien?

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:54.770
Why are you gettin' us involved in this?

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:59.170
Come on... If the worst happens, there's safety in numbers, right?

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:00.230
Yup.

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:03.280
Better than having her come to our homes and take us out one at a time.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.670
We're gonna be killed...

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.060
We're gonna be killed!

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.600
Don't worry!

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:11.210
Just 'cause she's an alien doesn't mean we're gonna get killed!

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:16.670
As long as we tell her we won't tell anyone, I'm sure she'll understand, right?

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:18.860
That's right!

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:22.070
Even though she's an alien, if we explain things, she'll understand!

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:23.230
That's right.

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:24.940
If it works out that way, sure...

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:25.640
Who's there?

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.220
I'm the kidnapper from yesterday.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.370
You call yourself a kidnapper?

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:35.070
I am speaking directly into your brains using those wristbands.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:40.670
Your homeroom teacher, Tachibana-sensei, really is an alien.

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:46.100
She's a cold-blooded assassin who even takes the lives of children if the price is right!

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:47.120
Assassin?

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:49.830
Yes! Evil! A super-villain!

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:54.760
To defeat her is, indeed, the first duty of the Color Rangers!

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:55.590
Screw you!

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:59.720
You want a bunch of elementary school kids to fight a real alien?

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:00.880
Don't worry.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.270
You each have various powers.

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:04.640
Did you read the manual?

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:06.010
Manual?

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:09.690
Yes! If you take care to read the manual,

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:15.060
and properly utilize the powers I have given you, even an assassin will be no match!

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.440
You can...

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:17.520
...do it!

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.620
I threw it out without a glance.

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:23.180
I never got one.

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:26.830
Happens a lot with you, Akagawa.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:29.330
Is this the manual?

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.530
Let's see...

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:35.780
Hey!

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:36.920
I'm Lil' Prince!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.680
And I'm going to talk about being a Color Ranger now!

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:41.060
3-D?

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:44.370
Color Rangers can use various weapons.

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:46.170
First, you have a kitchen knife and metal hammer!

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:47.820
Hey, wait a sec!

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:47.820
You can buy them at any store,

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:50.890
but you can't use 'em when you think about how much they have to hurt!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:51.870
Then there's...

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:53.360
Pistols and rifles!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.270
Even if your enemies are at a distance, with these you'll be okay!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.940
No, we won't!

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.430
Absolutely not a chance.

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:01.400
You can use many other powerful weapons.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:04.340
Tanks and fighter jets both have plenty of destructive power,

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:07.010
but they are quite expensive.

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.970
I suggest leftovers from the former Soviet Union!

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:10.410
Uh, no.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.180
And finally...

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:16.200
The nuclear missile!

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:22.930
But Japan has its three anti-nuclear weapons principles,

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:24.380
so getting your hands on one is really hard!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.180
Red Ranger

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:24.800
Battle Match

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:28.140
Blue Ranger

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:28.140
Battle Water

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:28.140
Quenches thirst flavorless and odorless

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:28.140
Yellow Ranger

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:28.140
Battle Light

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:28.140
Lights up the dark, power outages AOK

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:27.590
Anyway, enough joking around.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.140
Small flame, goes out fast

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:30.890
The Color Rangers can each use various spells!

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:32.300
For example:

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:36.250
The Red Ranger's level one spell is Battle Match!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.520
Battle Match?

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:42.940
Red...

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.700
Charge!

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:46.910
Battle...

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.250
Match!

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:50.680
You idiot!

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:51.840
Don't kick me, guys!

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:54.500
It still hurts even when I'm transformed.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:58.370
If you raise your level, you can use more powerful spells.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.880
How do we raise our level?

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:03.240
It raises in proportion to the time you stay transformed.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:06.180
In general, every 30 minutes you are transformed, you raise one level.

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:07.840
That's not gonna be fast enough, damn it!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.140
Oh, right!

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:12.560
If you get hurt in battle, head straight to the hospital!

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:16.480
You can't be brought back to life if you die, so be careful, 'kay?

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:19.650
So then, go fight, and win!

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:21.980
Win my butt!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.760
How are we supposed to beat an assassin with stuff like this?

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:26.630
Beat who, exactly?

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:39.590
Tachibana-sensei is really a...

00:15:39.590 --> 00:15:42.670
Yes. I normally use an alternate appearance.

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:46.510
But, why? I'm not even wearing the goggles...

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:51.600
If I manipulate the index of refraction and your sense of touch...

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:55.880
You said something about me being an assassin, didn't you?

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:57.860
How did you know that?

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:02.760
Sensei... Can you go back to your normal form first? Then we'll talk...

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:05.780
I prefer the way you usually look...

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.240
Hush!

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:14.300
Are you sure you want to break the school's desks, Sensei?

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:18.110
Stop prattling on, and answer my question.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:22.670
I've seen those wristbands.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.480
Oh, I know!

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:28.460
Those are toy transformation wristbands that were all the rage a little while ago on the Galactic Shopping Network.

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:30.320
T-Toy?

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:33.760
But we found out your identity using these!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:34.960
That's strange...

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:37.350
They're nothing more than child's toys.

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:41.390
They shouldn't have the ability to see through a photonic barrier.

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:47.470
And this armor is made with battle-ready shape-memory particles...

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:50.890
Where did you get those toys?

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:53.590
Come on, Class Rep, do something!

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:54.710
R-Right...

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:57.790
Battle Match!

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:59.450
What the hell was that for?

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.960
Don't ask me!

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.960
I'll ask you once more.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:05.040
Where did you get them?

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:08.780
A weird alien stuck them on us against our will!

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:10.660
A weird alien?

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:11.660
What was their name?

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:15.470
H-He said he was the Prince of Planet Dogura.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:17.780
Planet Dogura?

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:26.420
Ah, the Prince of Dogura...

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.500
Phew, what a relief.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.870
Doesn't look like anyone's actually after me.

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:33.200
Sensei... You know him?

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:36.240
Prince Baka, with the most warped mind in the galaxy.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:40.770
The rumors are that he's a horrible person, who makes trouble for other people

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:42.740
without a second thought, just to keep from being bored.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.370
To keep from being bored?

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:47.750
He probably noticed my real identity,

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:51.890
and thought it would be funny to make the students and their teacher fight.

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:54.040
Your real identity?

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:56.470
So, Sensei...

00:17:57.410 --> 00:18:00.470
Are you really an assassin?

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.310
Yes, I am.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:07.100
Why are you an assassin?

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.150
Is there some reason?

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:12.010
For my dream...

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:13.650
Your dream?

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:18.530
My dream was to save up money so I could travel the universe!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.710
Now that I've come to this planet, my dream of becoming a teacher came true, too!

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:24.080
Thank you, God!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.130
Are all aliens weirdos?

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:28.420
Sensei, I have a question.

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:32.130
How much would it cost to hire you to kill that Prince?

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:36.140
That's a good idea!

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.770
I'd do it for 50 million!

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:43.770
Guys! Hiring an assassin isn't what I'd call being on the side of justice!

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:46.430
The leader can shut the hell up now!

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:46.980
Right.

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:48.920
That's right!

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:52.190
We don't care about who you are, Sensei!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:57.410
All we want is to get these wristbands off and return to our normal lives.

00:18:57.410 --> 00:19:01.120
Yup! That's what I like about you guys.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:04.620
But it's no good to ask other people for help so soon.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.370
First, you need to handle it yourself somehow, okay?

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:12.540
If it's no use no matter what, come visit me again.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.800
'kay!

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:16.190
Oh, Sensei...

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:19.070
Is it true you even kill babies?

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:21.650
If the price is right...

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:24.220
Babies are expensive.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:28.050
So expensive that no one could ever pay the price.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.930
She's the type that only does in bad guys!

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:33.230
Looks like it.

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.110
Don't forget to do your homework!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.740
Right!

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:38.740
Good.

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:43.490
Now then...

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:44.710
Prince Baka!

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:47.330
You're the biggest bad guy here!

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.030
You hear me?!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:51.520
Guess that seems to be the case.

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:53.250
He totally accepts it.

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:56.860
Okay then, change of plans.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:58.770
I'll be the evil Demon Lord.

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:02.930
Huh? As if we'll play along, dumbass!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:08.720
As long as you have those wristbands on, my voice will be transmitted to you...

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:12.310
so I could force you to listen to my beautiful voice forever!

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:16.290
I've never been more pissed off my entire life.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.320
Let's combine our powers and beat that guy!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.320
To remove the wristbands, you need a key.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:26.700
But that key is held by my loyal servant devil, Craft.

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:28.620
He is located...

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:33.540
Captain...

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:35.730
What is that key?

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:36.910
No clue.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:40.590
But I have to protect it even if it costs me my life.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.300
Yamagata?

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:49.370
But the devil Craft is more powerful than a mid-boss, so you need to raise your level first.

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:51.440
We have no choice, don't we?

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:55.010
Do we really have to take them off?

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:56.780
Goddamn it!

00:20:56.780 --> 00:21:00.360
We're gonna take that key from this devil Craft person!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.740
And then we're gonna kick your ass!

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:09.120
And thus were the chromatic warriors of justice, the Color Rangers, born!

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.350
Stop doing such embarrassing narration!

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:14.170
Go! Color Rangers!

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:17.130
Fight! Color Rangers!

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.760
Defeat the devil Craft!

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:24.850
I am gonna kick your ass <i>so</i> bad, you'll see!

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:27.140
I'm home.

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.310
Welcome home.

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:31.710
Dear... Yoshiki is acting strangely.

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:34.090
He suddenly locked himself in his room.

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:37.020
Well, he's in a rebellious phase...

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:41.740
He's mumbling to himself, and then suddenly yells out in a loud voice...

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:44.160
I'm worried.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:47.320
Blue Charge!

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:57.610
Screw you, Prince Baka!

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:01.580
Shimitsu is now level 2!

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:03.380
Intelligence raised by 1.

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:06.370
He has learned the spell "Battle Pocari".

00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:09.060
S-Shut the hell up!

00:22:10.710 --> 00:22:12.520
See? It's weird...

00:22:14.390 --> 00:22:17.690
Yes... That'll do.

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:27.290
Are you ready?

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:37.800
Do not fear 'ima' mugen no kanata ni mienai mono o miyoutoshite

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:37.800
Do not fear 'The Now' searching for something that can't be seen across this infinite distance

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:52.020
nante oku no kirameki no shita de yume o sagasu kimi o mitsuketa

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:52.020
Under the hundred million glittering lights, I found you searching for your dream

00:22:52.020 --> 00:23:00.780
garasudama no naka hirogaru mugen no sekai

00:22:52.020 --> 00:23:00.780
An infinite world filled with glass shards

00:23:01.950 --> 00:23:12.840
imi no nai koto takusan shitte otona ni natta kigashiteita

00:23:01.950 --> 00:23:12.840
Growing up I felt I knew many meaningless things

00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:20.300
chiribame rare ta kimi ha tada kagayaki nagara sora ni mau kako mo mirai mo nai mama ni

00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:20.300
Shining like a jewel, you soar in the sky, no past, no future

00:23:20.300 --> 00:23:25.640
kotae ha sora no mukou gawa

00:23:20.300 --> 00:23:25.640
The answer is beyond the sky

00:23:25.640 --> 00:23:36.150
Do not fear 'yume' mugen no kanata ni shinjitsu mo uso mo mie nai mama de

00:23:25.640 --> 00:23:36.150
Do not fear 'The Dream', in a distant
place where truth and lies are unseen

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:51.880
nante oku no kirameki no shita de kaze ni yureru hana ha yurameku

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:51.880
Under the hundred million glittering lights, flowers sway in the wind

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:59.250
I'm up to level 10!

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:00.260
Key?

00:24:00.260 --> 00:24:02.370
Don't underestimate elementary school kids!

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:05.010
I totally practice karate!

00:24:03.060 --> 00:24:07.530
It doesn't look like we can win at our current level.

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:09.220
I can't remember the last one, no matter what...

00:24:07.620 --> 00:24:10.420
What'll I do about the outfits?

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:13.510
All's well that ends well!

00:24:11.970 --> 00:24:13.510
There you have it.

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:15.220
And we all lived happily ever after.

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:18.150
Next time: Dancing in the trap!!

00:24:18.150 --> 00:24:21.380
Welcome to the Tarsting Town!
